('2e77ea5f-a6ec-528c-9499-16dceb6e158f'::uuid,'est','"Plane Geometry, Measurement & Transformations"'::jsonb,'hard','mcq','"If two parallel lines are cut by a transversal, then corresponding angles are congruent.\nGiven k // l, transversal t cuts k and l. Prove: ∠1 ≅ ∠2.\nProof: 1. k // l (Given); 2. ∠3 ≅ ∠2 (………); 3. ∠1 ≅ ∠3 (Vertical angles are ≅); 4. ∠1 ≅ ∠2 (Transitive Prop.)\nWhat is the missing reason for statement 2?"'::jsonb,'[{"key":"A","text":"If two parallel lines are cut by a transversal then corresponding angles are equal"},{"key":"B","text":"If two parallel lines are cut by a transversal, then alt. int. angles are ≅"},{"key":"C","text":"Given"},{"key":"D","text":"Vertical angles are ≅"}]'::jsonb,'{"source":"Kimi Agent Math PDF Question Bank (4)","source_file":"book_t9.md","source_sha256":"417d165758ab4ea90b91891cea0b6cd71d4ad113c1cbac2ccd7241a361c29d57","source_question_id":"T9-36","import_batch":"est2-kimi-bank-2026-09-21","curriculum_lesson":"Plane Geometry, Measurement & Transformations"}'::jsonb,'"B"'::jsonb,'"Source-keyed answer from book_t9.md (T9-36)."'::jsonb),
('c9508df7-5005-5e86-aebe-4ac44ec4ec02'::uuid,'est','"Plane Geometry, Measurement & Transformations"'::jsonb,'hard','mcq','"If two lines are cut by a transversal and alternate interior angles are congruent, then the lines are parallel.\nGiven: transversal t cuts lines k and n, ∠1 ≅ ∠2. Prove: k // n.\nProof: 1. ∠1 ≅ ∠2 (Given); 2. ∠2 ≅ ∠3 (………); 3. ∠1 ≅ ∠3 (Transitive Property); 4. k // n (If two lines are cut by a transversal and corresponding angles are ≅, then the lines are //)\nWhat is the missing reason for statement 2?"'::jsonb,'[{"key":"A","text":"Vertical angles are ≅"},{"key":"B","text":"If two lines are parallel then interior angles are supplementary"},{"key":"C","text":"Given"},{"key":"D","text":"If two parallel lines are cut by a transversal then corresponding angles are equal"}]'::jsonb,'{"source":"Kimi Agent Math PDF Question Bank (4)","source_file":"book_t9.md","source_sha256":"417d165758ab4ea90b91891cea0b6cd71d4ad113c1cbac2ccd7241a361c29d57","source_question_id":"T9-37","import_batch":"est2-kimi-bank-2026-09-21","curriculum_lesson":"Plane Geometry, Measurement & Transformations"}'::jsonb,'"A"'::jsonb,'"Source-keyed answer from book_t9.md (T9-37)."'::jsonb),
